[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    220[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    221[0m:[38;5;10m[49m }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    222[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    223[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Row 16 — unflushed bytes are already in the shared `stdout` FILE buffer when
