[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    251[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     let vals: Vec<i32> = (0..200).map(|_| rng.range_i32(-300, 300)).collect();
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    252[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
